[00:00.89]Life
[00:02.76]That’s what you took from me
[00:04.15]And you also left me
[00:05.51]With an open wound
[00:08.73]Your eyes told me the lies
[00:11.17]That you couldn’t say yourself
[00:13.73]
[00:36.45]I wanted to give you heaven
[00:38.45]And I ended up on the ground
[00:42.71]Everyone told me not to give you everything
[00:48.36]Your sweet words convinced me
[00:54.01]I never saw what everyone saw
[00:57.50]I want you to feel what I felt, too, but even more
[01:04.57]It’s not fair that I’m suffering
[01:07.39]While you’re out there, acting like nothing’s wrong
[01:10.28]You even look happy, as if nothing had happened
[01:16.12]I don’t think you even realized
[01:18.72]That you almost killed someone
[01:22.07]I gave you the best I could
[01:24.67]Baby, I was the best I could be
[01:27.74]Your friends have told you, you shouldn’t have let me go
[01:34.47]I miss you, and it’s so obvious
[01:37.01]I wish I could be stronger
[01:39.96]And I try to hold back the tears
[01:43.08]But this is slowly killing me
[01:45.67]You didn’t feel my “I love yous”
[01:48.95]And I meant them from the bottom of my heart
[01:52.23]I feel like doing everything
[01:55.04]But now I have to learn to be alone
[02:00.85]
[02:20.31]I want you to feel it too
[02:24.38]What I felt, but even more
[02:27.45]It’s not fair that I’m suffering
[02:30.59]And you’re out there acting like nothing’s wrong
[02:33.33]You even look happy, as if nothing had happened
[02:39.29]I don’t think you’ve realized that you almost killed someone
[02:45.22]I miss you, and it’s so obvious
[02:48.37]I wish I could be stronger
[02:51.46]And I try to hold back my tears, but this is slowly killing me
[02:57.36]You never felt my “I love yous”
[03:00.33]And I’d say them from the bottom of my heart
[03:03.56]I feel like doing everything
[03:06.33]But now I have to learn to be alone